roda'=20
says that exactly two out of some (bunch of) dogs broda. 'lo re gerku cu br=
oda'=20
says that (a pack of) two dogs broda, with no commitment about any other do=
gs in=20
the world.  Indeed, all the 'lo' expressions say nothing about other dogs, =
just=20
this (some) bunch.  Well, 'lo ro broda' does talk about all the dogs in the=
=20
operant universe, but that is why it is a bad case.



